{
    "title": "PlayKids+ Cartoons and Games",
    "description": "A children\u2019s app where learning and fun become one!\r\n\r\nDiscover PlayKids+, the award-winning, safe and ad-free kids app that brings together your children\u2019s favorite videos, songs and games.Developed by experts in children\u2019s education, PlayKids+ promotes child development and is suitable for all kids aged 2-12 years. The app is COPPA certified for parents\u2019 peace of mind and it brings together 1,000+ cartoons, TV shows, educational games, and interactive activities. \r\nPlaykids+ is available in 180 countries in 4 languages.\r\n \r\nBe one of the more than 5 million families who already trust PlayKids+ to keep their kids safely entertained.   to learn about the best app for educational experiences.\r\n \r\nWhy subscribe to PlayKids+?\r\n- It's 100% safe with no ads\r\n- PlayKids+ is KidSAFE and COPPA certified, KidSAFE certified, Parents' Choice, Nappa (National Parenting Product - Awards) and the Michael Cohen Group.\r\n- Peace of mind for parents with content and screen time controls\r\n- Content available offline with downloadable content\r\n- Simultaneous access on more than one device\r\n- Created by early childhood education specialists to fit children\u2019s different learning stages and ages \r\n- Topics covered in the app include literature, arts, music, math, meditation, phonics, spelling, and more\r\n- Encourages offline play with arts and crafts activities, songs and exercises \r\n- The app features original and exclusive content including: Junior, Theo, Kate, Mimi e Lupi, Kantal\u00e1, SuperHands, Tiny Balloon, Lupi Club, and  more\r\n- Your child's favorite series are here like: Saturday Club, Two Minute Tales, Alphablocks, Numberblocks, Cutie Pugs, Talking Tom and Friends, Baby Shark, Masha and the Bear, Pingu, and much more\r\n \r\n\r\nSUBSCRIPTION DETAILS:\r\n\r\nAfter an initial 3 days FREE trial,your paid subscription to PlayKids+ will begin. This will give you access to the app's entire library of videos, games, music, and news! \r\n\r\nHere's how it works:\r\n \r\nChoose between a monthly or annual subscription plan that fits your preference. \r\nThe subscription is renewed automatically unless the account is deactivated at least 24 hours before the end of the current subscription period. \r\nYou can deactivate your account any time after purchase by accessing your account settings. \r\nYour annual subscription payment may be refunded and your service canceled if you request it within seven days after purchase.\r\nYour trial period ends when a paid subscription is purchased.\r\n \r\nPrivacy Policy: https://policies.playkidsapp.com/en/privacy \r\nTerms of Service: https://policies.playkidsapp.com/en/tos/\r\n \r\nContent may vary by country. Log on to http://support.playkidsapp.com/ if you have any questions.",
    "descriptionHTML": "A children\u2019s app where learning and fun become one!<br><br>Discover PlayKids+, the award-winning, safe and ad-free kids app that brings together your children\u2019s favorite videos, songs and games.Developed by experts in children\u2019s education, PlayKids+ promotes child development and is suitable for all kids aged 2-12 years. The app is COPPA certified for parents\u2019 peace of mind and it brings together 1,000+ cartoons, TV shows, educational games, and interactive activities. <br>Playkids+ is available in 180 countries in 4 languages.<br> <br>Be one of the more than 5 million families who already trust PlayKids+ to keep their kids safely entertained.   to learn about the best app for educational experiences.<br> <br>Why subscribe to PlayKids+?<br>- It&#39;s 100% safe with no ads<br>- PlayKids+ is KidSAFE and COPPA certified, KidSAFE certified, Parents&#39; Choice, Nappa (National Parenting Product - Awards) and the Michael Cohen Group.<br>- Peace of mind for parents with content and screen time controls<br>- Content available offline with downloadable content<br>- Simultaneous access on more than one device<br>- Created by early childhood education specialists to fit children\u2019s different learning stages and ages <br>- Topics covered in the app include literature, arts, music, math, meditation, phonics, spelling, and more<br>- Encourages offline play with arts and crafts activities, songs and exercises <br>- The app features original and exclusive content including: Junior, Theo, Kate, Mimi e Lupi, Kantal\u00e1, SuperHands, Tiny Balloon, Lupi Club, and  more<br>- Your child&#39;s favorite series are here like: Saturday Club, Two Minute Tales, Alphablocks, Numberblocks, Cutie Pugs, Talking Tom and Friends, Baby Shark, Masha and the Bear, Pingu, and much more<br> <br><br>SUBSCRIPTION DETAILS:<br><br>After an initial 3 days FREE trial,your paid subscription to PlayKids+ will begin. This will give you access to the app&#39;s entire library of videos, games, music, and news! <br><br>Here&#39;s how it works:<br> <br>Choose between a monthly or annual subscription plan that fits your preference. <br>The subscription is renewed automatically unless the account is deactivated at least 24 hours before the end of the current subscription period. <br>You can deactivate your account any time after purchase by accessing your account settings. <br>Your annual subscription payment may be refunded and your service canceled if you request it within seven days after purchase.<br>Your trial period ends when a paid subscription is purchased.<br> <br>Privacy Policy: https://policies.playkidsapp.com/en/privacy <br>Terms of Service: https://policies.playkidsapp.com/en/tos/<br> <br>Content may vary by country. Log on to http://support.playkidsapp.com/ if you have any questions.",
